{
  "name": "W01 · Conversão real (Kommo → trilha-api → Meta/Google)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "w01-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook Kommo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "trilha-w01-kommo",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kommo/:cliente",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w01-ok",
      "name": "Responder 200 ao Kommo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "ok",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w01-filtro",
      "name": "Lead novo ou mudança de etapa?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ],
      "notes": "O Kommo também manda 'lead alterado' (leads[update]) quando esse evento está marcado no webhook. A trilha-api ignoraria; aqui o fluxo nem a chama.",
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-etapa",
              "leftValue": "={{ Object.keys($('Webhook Kommo').item.json.body || {}).some(k => k.startsWith('leads[status]') || k.startsWith('leads[add]')) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w01-api",
      "name": "trilha-api /conversao",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.TRILHA_API_URL }}/conversao",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ cliente_id: $('Webhook Kommo').item.json.params.cliente, webhook_token: $('Webhook Kommo').item.json.query.token, corpo: $('Webhook Kommo').item.json.body, simular: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "notes": "A trilha-api confere o segredo do cliente (KOMMO_WEBHOOK_TOKEN_<CLIENTE>), a conta Kommo e a etapa real do lead. 403 aqui = tentativa recusada; o W10 avisa. Repetições são seguras: Meta deduplica por event_id e Google por orderId. TRILHA_API_URL vem do ambiente do n8n (infra/docker-compose.yml e infra/local/docker-compose.yml).",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "DEFINIR_APOS_IMPORTAR",
          "name": "trilha-api (Authorization: Bearer …)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w01-pulados",
      "name": "Algo foi pulado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-pulados",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.resumo && $json.resumo.pulados || []).filter(p => !p.includes('uso interno')).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-slack",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL || '').startsWith('https://') }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Avisa só se houver Slack configurado; sem ele, o resumo fica na execução (ambiente local guarda as bem-sucedidas)."
    },
    {
      "id": "w01-slack",
      "name": "Avisar operação (Slack)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: `:warning: Conversão real — ${$json.cliente}: evento não enviado\\n• ` + ($json.resumo.pulados || []).filter(p => !p.includes('uso interno')).join('\\n• ') }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Kommo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder 200 ao Kommo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Responder 200 ao Kommo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Lead novo ou mudança de etapa?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "trilha-api /conversao": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Algo foi pulado?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Algo foi pulado?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Avisar operação (Slack)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Lead novo ou mudança de etapa?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "trilha-api /conversao",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "errorWorkflow": "DEFINIR_ID_DO_W10_APOS_IMPORTAR"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
